\title{shinygridtools: Grid Entry and Baskets for 'shinyformtools' Forms}
\description{
Enter many related records of a 'shinyformtools' form at once in a spreadsheet-like grid. 'grid_input()' is a grid of number cells as a 'Shiny' input and as a field type: keyboard navigation, block paste from a spreadsheet, live sums. 'grid_server()' shows the records of a group as a grid, one record per row (wide) or per cell (long), and saves the cells the user changed in one transaction, with a per-cell check against other users' changes and their entries shown every few seconds. 'cart_input()' is a basket field: items dragged from a palette whose stock is shared by every basket, checked on every save, with a board that moves pieces between records. Built on the extension API of 'shinyformtools'.
}
